{"sections":[{"slug":"配边范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"配边范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"配边范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">暂且给出一种直观而不严格的描述</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">首先回忆流形上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/切结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">切结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对于整数</span> $0\\leq m \\leq n$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $m$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$-<strong><span lang=\"zh\">标架</span></strong> (framing) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $TM \\oplus \\mathbb{R}^{n-m}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的平凡化</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于子群</span> $G\\subset\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">或群同态</span> $G \\to \\mathrm{GL}_n$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\zeta$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbf{B}G\\to\\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶向量丛</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $m$-<span lang=\"zh\">维流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/切结构","text":"$G$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为映射</span> $\\chi\\colon M\\to\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及同构</span> $TM\\oplus \\mathbb{R}^{n-m}\\simeq \\chi^*\\zeta$.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">注意到带边</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">带角</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">流形上的标架自然地诱导其边界上的标架</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">粗略版本</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">标架配边范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Bord}_n^{G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是如下</span> $(\\infty,n)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为带</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">标架的</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $0&lt; k\\leq n$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">带角</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\partial f = X\\sqcup_{\\partial X=\\partial Y}Y$ (<span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的边界上的标架与</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">相容</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $X\\to Y,Y\\to Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">的复合为沿</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">粘合</span>;</li>\n<li>$n$-<span lang=\"zh\">态射之间的映射空间为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">维配边之间的同胚以及同胚之间的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">同痕</span></strong> (isotopy) <span lang=\"zh\">构成的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/配边假设","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边假设</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拓扑场论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑场论</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}